@page
@{ ViewData["Title"] = L["Privacy Policy"]; }
<div class="legal">
  <h1>@L["Privacy Policy"]</h1>
  <p class="muted">@L["Draft — to be reviewed by Inticoo legal counsel before launch."]</p>
  <h2>1. Information we collect</h2><p>Company and contact details you provide at registration, billing records, and usage data needed to operate the service. Card numbers are never stored by Inticoo; payments are processed by our payment provider.</p>
  <h2>2. How we use it</h2><p>To provide and secure the service, issue invoices, provide support and communicate product updates.</p>
  <h2>3. Security</h2><p>Each company's data lives in its own database with separate credentials. Credentials and secrets are encrypted at rest.</p>
  <h2>4. Your rights</h2><p>You may request access, correction or deletion of your personal data by contacting info@inticoo.com.</p>
</div>
